---
import PlainSummary from '../PlainSummary.astro';
---
<section class="sec sec--pin" id="module-02" aria-labelledby="m2-h" data-depth="0.37" data-scene="module-02">
  <div class="pin">
  <div class="wrap mod__grid">
    <div class="col smudge">
      <p class="eyebrow">MODULE 02 · FIELD READINESS</p>
      <h2 class="h2 recede-h" id="m2-h">Take the archive into the field.</h2>
      <p class="narr recede">Signal is not guaranteed where you’re going. Install Deepwell like an app, save the files you’ll need, and go. Tunnel, plane, a site with no reception: the archive comes with you, and it remembers exactly where you stopped.</p>
      <ul class="feat">
        <li><strong>Truly offline.</strong><br/>Save articles and read them with no connection at all.</li>
        <li><strong>Never lose your place.</strong><br/>Deepwell resumes at the exact paragraph, every time.</li>
        <li><strong>Your library.</strong><br/>Keep the files you love close, organized the way you like.</li>
      </ul>
      <PlainSummary>Install it, save articles, read with no internet. It remembers your place.</PlainSummary>
    </div>
    <div class="mod__visual mod__visual--low">
      <ol class="steps smudge" aria-label="In the field">
        <li><span class="steps__n">01</span>Save</li>
        <li><span class="steps__n">02</span>Lose signal</li>
        <li><span class="steps__n">03</span>Resume</li>
      </ol>
      <figure class="reader reader--sm fieldcard" aria-label="Saved for field use, no signal, and resumed at paragraph 14, where the reader stopped">
        <i class="reader__lamp" aria-hidden="true" style="opacity: 0.7"></i>
        <i class="reader__edge" aria-hidden="true" style="opacity: 0.7"></i>
        <div class="reader__meta" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="fieldcard__save"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v12"></path><path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5"></path><path d="M5 21h14"></path></svg><span class="fieldcard__swap"><span class="fieldcard__saving">Saving for field use…</span><span class="fieldcard__saved">Saved for field use ✓</span></span></span>
          <span class="fieldcard__signal"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="currentColor"><rect class="fieldcard__bar" x="1" y="9" width="3" height="4" rx="0.5"></rect><rect class="fieldcard__bar" x="5.5" y="5.5" width="3" height="7.5" rx="0.5"></rect><rect class="fieldcard__bar" x="10" y="1" width="3" height="12" rx="0.5"></rect></svg><span class="fieldcard__nosig">No signal</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="reader__prog" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
        <div class="reader__body">
          <div class="reader__para reader__para--read"><p>The clerk wrote in pencil, in case anything needed to be revised. Nothing was. The drawers were counted again the next night, and the night after that.</p></div>
          <div class="reader__para reader__para--here"><i class="reader__rule" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="reader__mark">¶ 14 · Where you stopped</span><p>By the fourth floor the drawers had stopped agreeing with the index. There were more of them than the plans allowed for, and they ran further back than the walls. The clerk counted anyway. That was the job.</p></div>
        </div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
  <i class="pin-rail" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><b style="--at: 0.35"></b><b style="--at: 0.65"></b></i>
  </div>
</section>
